{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wit the advent of FTL travel, a new frontier springs up over once unreachable asteroids. Mining transforms into a gold rush across the stars, with every jump opening up another uncharted stone rich in metals, ice, and exotic elements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You set out with your small mining vessel to the fringes of the solar system, and beyond. Dock near drifting asteroids, suit up, and step into the void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982440/extras/c98af1ba095ab6ccf35a7c3c040fb083.poster.avif?t=1767546601\" width=466 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982440/extras/c98af1ba095ab6ccf35a7c3c040fb083.webm?t=1767546601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3982440/extras/c98af1ba095ab6ccf35a7c3c040fb083.mp4?t=1767546601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated asteroids with distinct geological types and color palettes ensures no run is the same.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risk-reward gameplay loop: leave the ship, mine under time pressure, hopefully return alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep progression with ship modules, equipment upgrades, and craftable consumables that lets you endure harsher conditions and dig deeper towards the coveted cores.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover hidden veins. Scan, probe, and blast through layers of stone to reveal riches.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" s